start timer workTimer
say workTimer
wait 50 milliseconds
elapsed is elapsed milliseconds of workTimer
if elapsed is at least 45
    say "waited"
.
seconds is elapsed time of workTimer
if seconds is less than 5
    say "seconds ok"
.
try
    total is workTimer plus 1
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    x is elapsed time of 5
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
try
    wait "soon" seconds
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
minusOne is 0 minus 1
try
    wait minusOne seconds
otherwise into reason
    say reason
.
if workTimer is workTimer
    say "same timer"
.
wait 0 SECONDS
wait 0.01 minute
say "end"
